# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Repo-root .gitignore
#
#  Note: src/ShopEase.Web/.gitignore (Angular CLI) already covers the
#  frontend, but a .gitignore only applies to its own folder and below —
#  so the .NET side needs to be handled here.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── .NET build output ── ~90 MB, fully regenerated by `dotnet build`
**/bin/
**/obj/

# ── Node / Angular ── ~447 MB, regenerated by `npm ci` and `ng build`
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/tmp/
**/out-tsc/

# ── Editors & OS ──
.vs/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Logs ──
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ── Backups taken before containerising / migrating ──
*.bak

# ── Secrets: never commit these ──
# Real values belong in the hosting platform's environment settings
# (Vercel / Render dashboards) or in dotnet user-secrets locally.
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/appsettings.Production.json
*.pfx
*.p12
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
